  <revision rev="9" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>e649f113d46a4b7814c42e7d2dc9a939</srcmd5>
    <version>1.23</version>
    <time>1791835698</time>
    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>Update to version 1.23
  * New -t option makes the map a torus, new -g WIDTHxHEIGHT option
    sets the map size, -S 0 disables autosave
  * Save file format bumped to version 3: saved games from earlier
    releases are rejected as unsupported
  * Saving uses atomic replacement, restoring is transactional,
    fix saving of variable-sized maps
  * Fix an old bug in transport selection not filtered by owner,
    the fighter landing logic, city placement on custom maps and
    an off-by-one in the display code
  * Avoid potential overruns (zoom walkers, input buffer handling)
  * Further code hardening; docs converted to AsciiDoc
- Packaging changes for the new upstream Makefile:
  * Pass PREFIX at install time as the Makefile no longer honors
    DESTDIR; drop the sed on PREFIX
  * Build only the binary target, the man page is shipped
    pre-generated (no asciidoctor build dependency)
  * Appdata file is now vms-empire.adoc, NEWS is now NEWS.adoc
  * Add BuildRequires gcc and make, use pkgconfig(ncurses)
  * Drop obsolete Group tag</comment>
    <requestid>1384317</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
